    "description": "Polished Orthoceras Fossil Specimen in Black Matrix Stone Oval Shape\nProduct Overview:\nThis item is a polished Orthoceras fossil specimen embedded in black matrix stone. The fossil displays a distinctive segmented, conical shape in white and gray against the dark stone background. The front surface is smoothly polished to reveal the fossil's details, while the back remains rough and unfinished.\nSpecifications:\nFossil Type: Orthoceras\nMaterial: Black matrix stone with embedded fossil\nShape: Elongated oval\nSurface Finish: Polished front, rough back\nColor: White and gray fossil against dark stone\n6.25 x 1.8 x 6.5 in\nAll items are pre-owned and described as accurately as possible, however we are not experts in any field. Please feel free to contact us with any additional questions.\nYour purchase allows Goodwill Industries-Suncoast to fulfill our mission of transforming lives through lifelong learning and the power of work while seeking ways to enhance our communities’ environmental resources.\nThis mission is accomplished through employment services, training programs, and affordable housing. The sale of donated goods enables Goodwill Industries-Suncoast to offer a variety of employment and training services, promote self-sufficiency, and contribute to community conservation through recycling.\nThank you for your support!",
